				"Cannons are loaded from the muzzle - powder charges, then the projectile - and fired with redstone. Every cannon has a limit; overload one and it bursts."
				""
				"&cCannon fire breaks blocks.&f Agree with your friends where to test, and keep it away from the colony."
				""
				"Hold &eW&f over any part for Ponder."
